{"unit_id":"KevinZhangNothing__dsh-task-graph#card-zh","repo":"KevinZhangNothing/dsh-task-graph","commit":"7c230e0fe0af8103cfc2d1ee6ecf74a4f0c872aa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-graph（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把单个任务的执行过程整理成可交互图谱。它读取 DSH 会话轨迹并在 Web 界面加入图谱视图，可查看轮次、Agent、工具、Skill、子代理、代码改动、测试和重试，也能切换布局、搜索节点、查看关键路径并联动轨迹事件。适合需要回顾任务执行步骤、定位失败或比较耗时的 DSH Web 用户。使用时需要本机 DSH 会话文件和支持原生 zstd 的 Node。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21","lib/graph.js:131","lib/client.js:1737"]}
{"unit_id":"KevinZhangNothing__dsh-task-graph#card-en","repo":"KevinZhangNothing/dsh-task-graph","commit":"7c230e0fe0af8103cfc2d1ee6ecf74a4f0c872aa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-graph adds an interactive graph to DSH Web. It displays turns, agents, tools, skills, subtasks, edits, tests, and retries. Users can search nodes, switch layouts, inspect critical paths, and link nodes to trajectory events. It reads local sessions and needs Node with native zstd.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21","lib/graph.js:131","lib/client.js:1737"]}
